<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>QUANT ENGINE v13.27 [FULL TRACKING]</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/echarts@5.4.3/dist/echarts.min.js"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="progress-bar"></div>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">⚡ QUANT ENGINE <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--accent-gold);">v13.27 FULL TRACKING</span></div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
            <span class="status-tag">FinMind API ONLY</span>
            <span id="clock" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent-gold);">00:00:00</span>
        </div>
    </header>
    <div class="dashboard-grid">
        <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
                <span>📈 個股日線與專屬邏輯軌跡</span>
                <div class="chart-controls">
                    <button class="btn btn-magic" id="btn-auto-opt">🔍 智慧搜尋最佳參數與模式</button>
                    <button class="btn" id="btn-reset" onclick="initChart()">↺ 重置視野</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-wrapper"><div id="kline-chart"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header"><span>🎯 個股專屬策略表現與次日掛單指引</span></div>
            <div class="prob-section">
                <div class="prob-card prob-long"><div class="prob-title">▲ 多方勝率</div><div class="prob-val up-text" id="prob-long-val">--%</div></div>
                <div class="prob-card prob-short"><div class="prob-title">▼ 空方勝率</div><div class="prob-val down-text" id="prob-short-val">--%</div></div>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 6px 10px 0 10px;">
                <div class="metric-box" style="background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08); border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4); text-align: left; padding: 8px 10px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                        <span class="metric-title" style="color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: bold;">⚡ 次日掛單指引與價位計算</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                        <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-sub);">輸入今日開盤價:</span>
                        <input type="number" id="manual-open-price" step="0.05" placeholder="例如: 401.5" style="background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: var(--accent-gold); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; width: 100px; outline: none;" oninput="updateNextDayGuide()">
                    </div>
                    <div id="next-action-guide" style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.4;">正在計算次日進場方向與掛單價位...</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metrics-grid">
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">前日法人買賣超</div><div class="metric-value" id="val-chips">0 張</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">當前配置代碼</div><div class="metric-value" style="color: var(--accent-gold);" id="val-symbol-tag">2327</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">進場頻率模式</div><div class="metric-value" style="color: var(--accent-gold);" id="val-mode-tag">自動順勢</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">正確盈虧比 (PF)</div><div class="metric-value" id="val-odds" style="color: var(--accent-gold);">--</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">防守停損幅</div><div class="metric-value" style="color: var(--accent-cyan);" id="val-trail-box">2.0%</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">個股狀態</div><div class="metric-value up-text">v13.27 部署版</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header"><span>⚙️ 個股專屬參數設定與切換</span></div>
            <div class="strategy-container">
                <div class="strategy-inputs">
                    <div style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 2px;">⚡ 清單快速切換：</div>
                    <div class="stock-quick-bar">
                        <button class="btn" id="q-2408" onclick="selectStock('2408')">2408 南亞科</button>
                        <button class="btn" id="q-3037" onclick="selectStock('3037')">3037 欣興</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-active" id="q-2327" onclick="selectStock('2327')">2327 國巨</button>
                        <button class="btn" id="q-3105" onclick="selectStock('3105')">3105 穩懋</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input-group"><label>股票代碼</label><input type="text" id="stock-symbol" value="2327" onchange="onSymbolManualChange()"></div>
                    <div class="input-group"><label>策略模式</label><select id="input-mode" onchange="saveCurrentInputToProfile()"><option value="TREND">自動順勢 (Trend)</option><option value="REVERSAL">自動逆勢 (Reversal)</option></select></div>
                    <div class="input-group"><label>乖離率門檻 (%)</label><input type="number" id="input-bias-threshold" value="1.5" step="0.5" onchange="saveCurrentInputToProfile()"></div>
                    <div class="input-group"><label>籌碼過濾 (張)</label><input type="number" id="input-chip-threshold" value="300" step="100" onchange="saveCurrentInputToProfile()"></div>
                    <div class="input-group"><label>移動追蹤回撤幅 (%)</label><input type="number" id="input-trailing-back" value="2.5" step="0.5" onchange="saveCurrentInputToProfile()"></div>
                    <div class="input-group"><label>防守停損幅 (%)</label><input type="number" id="input-sl" value="2.0" step="0.5" onchange="saveCurrentInputToProfile()"></div>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-fetch" style="margin-top: 4px;">📡 載入該股數據</button>
                </div>
                <div class="strategy-output" id="strategy-list"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header"><span>💻 波段追蹤日誌 (FinMind API Output)</span></div>
            <div class="terminal-logs" id="log-terminal"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal" id="report-modal">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <h3 style="color: var(--accent-gold);" id="modal-title">個股專屬波段回測報告</h3>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-sub);">天數:</span>
                    <button class="btn" id="btn-15d" onclick="changeBacktestDays(15)">15日</button>
                    <button class="btn" id="btn-30d" onclick="changeBacktestDays(30)">30日</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-active" id="btn-60d" onclick="changeBacktestDays(60)">60日</button>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()" style="margin-left: 8px;">✕ 關閉</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metrics-grid" style="padding: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">累積收益 (個股專屬)</div><div class="metric-value up-text" id="m-ret">+0.0%</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">波段勝率</div><div class="metric-value" id="m-win">0.0%</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">正確盈虧比 (PF)</div><div class="metric-value" id="m-pf" style="color: var(--accent-gold);">0.00</div></div>
                <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-title">單日最大虧損</div><div class="metric-value down-text" id="m-mdd">-0.0%</div></div>
            </div>
            <h4 style="color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-top: 10px;">⚡ 完整交易足跡 (前日收盤判定、當日開高低與實際進出場)</h4>
            <div style="max-height: 420px; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin-top: 6px;">
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>#</th><th>交易日期</th><th>前日法人買賣超</th><th>當天決策狀態</th><th>前日收盤價</th><th>當日開盤價</th><th>當日最高價</th><th>當日最低價</th><th>當日進場價</th><th>當日出場價</th><th>波段獲利%</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="modal-trades"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
